  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bdim/D]\n[F#7]\nSummer-\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bm6/F#]time [Gdim7]\n[Bm6/F#]And the [Gdim7]livin' is\n[Gdim7][Bm6/F#]easy\n[Bm6/F#][Gdim7]Fish are\n[Em7]jumpin' [G6]\n[Em7]And the cotton is\n[F#7]high\nOh, your\n[Bm6/F#]daddy's [Gdim7]rich\n[Bm6/F#]And your [Gdim7]mamma's good\n[Gdim7][Bm6/F#]looki-\n[Bm6/F#]n' [E7]So\n[D]hush little baby\n[E7]Don't [A7]you\n[Bm]cry\n[F#7]\n[Bm]\n[E7]One of these\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bm6/F#]mornings [Gdim7]\n[Bm6/F#]You're going to [Gdim7]rise up\n[Gdim7][Bm6/F#]singi-\n[Bm6/F#]ng [Gdim7]Then you'll\n[Em7]spread your [G6]wings\n[Em7]And you'll fly to the\n[F#7]sky\nBut till that\n[Bm6/F#]morning [Gdim7]\n[Bm6/F#]There's a [Gdim7]nothing can\n[Bm6/F#]harm [Gdim7]you\n[Bm6/F#][E7]With your\n[D]daddy and mamma\n[A7][E7]standing\n[Bm]by .\n[E7]  [A7]\n[D7]  [G7]\n[C]  [F#6/C#]\n\n[Outro]\n[Bm]",
